## Purpose

This temporary same-repository PR existed only to validate the final manual acceptance item for Archimedes mission `MSN-00015`.

## Result

Acceptance succeeded in GitHub Actions run `30706913841`:

- the verified MCP server started with a repository-scoped GitHub Actions token;
- writes were enabled at process start;
- `post_review_comment` was called with `confirm=true` on the fixture line;
- exactly one inline review comment was created;
- the same comment was returned by `list_pr_comments` after **1,160 ms**;
- the five-second visibility requirement passed;
- request duration was 562 ms;
- credential-like evidence checks passed;
- artifact digest: `571567b360c61c8a66f8a2581bba3e870f2bd4d5853cc2b7c3276d7666f756f0`.

The fixture is not intended for main, so this PR is closed without merge. This evidence does not represent npm publication, Archimedes submission, acceptance, payment, or revenue.
